001B3Er 2               
001B3Er 2               ; emit_LDCS — emit OP_LDCS followed by length byte and string bytes.
001B3Er 2               ; Source string lives in ident_buf (length at [0], chars at [1..N]).
001B3Er 2               ; The runtime will inline-fetch length+chars and push the address of
001B3Er 2               ; the length byte as a Pascal-style string pointer.
